<title>USA: TENNIS-FED CUP FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FED CUP FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTIC CITY, N.J. 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the best-of-five Fed Cup final between the United States and Spain on Sunday: Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) 3-6 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>(U.S. leads 3-0)  </p>
<p>Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Gala Leon Garcia (Spain) 7-5 6-2 Mary Joe Fernandez and Linda Wild (U.S.) beat Gala Leon Garcia and Virginia Ruano-Pascal (Spain) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>(U.S. wins best-of-five tie 5-0)</p>
</text>
